      "title": "pw-eth-nocw: Strengthen the heuristic check",
      "message": "pw-eth-nocw: Strengthen the heuristic check\n\nCheck the captured length; don't throw an exception on truncated\npackets in a heuristic check.\n\nLook up not just OUIs but also MA-M, MA-S, and individually registered\nethernet addresses like broadcast (FF-FF-FF-FF-FF-FF).\n\nCheck the Ethertype. We could do a bit more for the when the type/length\nfield is a length to rule out some more cases.\n\nIf it looks like an 802.2 frame, check the DSAP and SSAP. We could\ngo even deeper in the case where they are both 0xAA and see if it\nlooks like a valid SNAP header.\n\nFix #13295. Related to #13039, #13306.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-06-07T09:10:05.000-04:00",
